{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"cab58c1abd51e37ae3bbbe8a1f46049ccad43ec6a3f4d30a96d79f8b9968059b","ja":"あっ……せ、星梨花ちゃんの声が、聞こえます……！\nこ、ここのドアを……開ければ……っ！","zh":"啊……星、星梨花的声音，能听见……！\n只、只要把这里的门……打开……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cc76becdc1a3c7a56fb6d7f11ce109d5d3eec083b6a4a7570f2e2f03a636669a","ja":"ここは……ひ、控室……？\nあっ、星梨花ちゃん……！　ひなたちゃんも！","zh":"这里是……休、休息室……？\n啊，星梨花……！日向也在！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"75d5cb575f72addddd3a4ee9e2cb733b7ccd4e4bd4ba7be22c7a070947c43a2d","ja":"なるほど……小部屋のドアは、\nこんなところにつながっていたんですね～。","zh":"原来如此……小房间的门，竟然通向这种地方呀～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1ce3c271da7afe9c1871650ee8cfe9b50417ca08f5a7a3df77d1381f36b31e6c","ja":"ともあれ、ライブ前に星梨花ちゃんを見つけることが\nできてよかったです～。迷宮入り寸前でした～。","zh":"总之，能在演唱会前找到星梨花，真是太好了～差点就要变成悬案了～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fe0a8215de8e05d6bda53c20c79c0d72d26bf3c7700fc5746f51a643d545fe9f","ja":"ライブだから、わたしを呼びにきてくれたんですか？\n可憐さん、美也さん、ありがとうございます♪","zh":"因为是演唱会，所以特意来叫我的吗？\n可怜、美也，谢谢你们♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4909e77d67ed0427d9e5e4aa1ce83762dbbfa41556ccd4b21566e9112db896ee","ja":"壁に埋まったドアから、可憐さんと美也さんが……！\n星梨花ちゃん、どういうことだい？","zh":"从嵌在墙里的门里，可怜和美也竟然……！\n星梨花，你这是怎么回事？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b5aab5c2b8e6e26768fd9286dac914e28557d58b9631e404bdadd448a3f9d680","ja":"地下の小部屋とつながってる、隠し通路があるんです！\n劇場のいろんなところにつながっているみたいで……。","zh":"这里有一条与地下小房间相连的秘密通道！\n好像能通往剧场的各个地方……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"cd9893a4c85351781f13f01f69f9fbb54cc644bc42e5e863cf4d45e6258cb47a","ja":"隠し通路……そういうことだったのかい。\nふたりとも、そこを通ってきたんだねぇ。","zh":"隐藏通道……原来是这么回事啊。\n你们两个都是从那里过来的呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"659464694ef3fb3a719b5f29f44f8b4bbd5df0ca50919dbb4528ad0a85f494e6","ja":"あの小部屋、探検するたびにあたらしい発見が\nあるんですよ♪　隠し通路のほかにもいろいろ……。","zh":"每次探索那个小房间，都会有新的发现哦♪除了隐藏通道之外，还有各种各样的东西……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d2db704ae2b36b383edf3e67ddc7ad2d23977676cf98dcfceea0acf41635f3d5","ja":"へえ、星梨花ちゃんはあの小部屋の秘密、\nたくさん知ってるんだねぇ。","zh":"哦，星梨花知道那个小房间的很多秘密呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"8d173860876977d47d595cf2b970a7f88266538b520c37052a529071fec566b9","ja":"今度、あたしにも教えてくれるかい？\nあたしたち4人だけの秘密、もっと増やしちゃうべさ！","zh":"下次也教教我，好吗？  \n让只属于我们4人的秘密变得更多吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"7ac78df62510be964efb0c413aa9d89b44ac0d17061a62266fc065616575d36d","ja":"はい、もちろんです！　わたしの秘密で、\nみなさんと、もっともっと仲良くなりたいです♪","zh":"是的，当然可以！我想用我的秘密，和大家变得更加更加亲密♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"7d327bf86eec3bbb99b921c3f20a09fc1b2bb7d4f32ec978bbbfede7fbc8a701","ja":"一件落着ですな～♪　時間もちょうどですし、\nライブの準備に向かいましょう～。","zh":"事情圆满解决啦～♪ 时间也刚刚好，我们去准备演唱会吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_853.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"a12223a9825716147d8ee8a518781eeb1993cb04a02e6398531e8ed1efcc5896","ja":"ま、間に合ってよかったです。……そ、それにしても、\nこの劇場って実は、な、謎が多いのかな……？","zh":"还、还好赶上了……太好了。……不、不过话说回来，\n这个剧场其实是不是有、有很多谜团啊……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
